  "body": "Publish fixed native correctness evidence and an inspected two-page report for the guarded coefficient compiler merged through #5040. The compiler receives public Spec,R,Q with five unknown normalized coefficients and two inverse guards. The original actual-q/a,k20633 program has4597568 variables/4597589 quadratic equations; all15 fixed arms plus completion finish successfully. Known coefficients enter a separate extension control, followed by unchanged original indexed/group replay. PCC-20261123-7f4e38 is unsigned/unverified; these are representation and fixed-control results. [pcc:unverified]\n\nValidation: four focused release tests, fmt and strict all-target Clippy; all54 composite source hashes, ten compiled-in hashes and immutable binary46e75f76 match before/after the one fixed call. Controls include101 coefficient-pencil values, eight toy sign patterns, two identity-R sections, both original-q actual cases, torsion checks and wire/refusal controls. The report, editable diagram and recorded-count graph are pinned by unsigned PCC-20261123-c1b0dc; PROOF_MAP.md identifies formal compiler/certificate gaps. Unknown-coefficient discovery and growing-family complete cold-cost/useful-yield accounting remain open. [pcc:unverified]\n\nPublication is incomplete: the full native archive117571164bytes, SHA256697a904ccfdafc58a503396ab3858055185243f2abab8e8a273c024f25525337, retains all43 file members and24 complete program/assignment exports locally. Genuine trusted upload plus remote hash/size replay is required. No new unchanged S3 retry was made; a Git commit or incremental artifact-policy pass is not an upload receipt. Keep this continuation draft while that publication dependency remains unresolved. [pcc:unverified]\n\nCanonical1805 ledger rows remain an exact prefix with only three new statements appended. The complete canonical journal prefix and historical pending entries are preserved. Partial closures for #5022 and #5040 record actual merge/check timing and matching episodes/outcomes; final-head required checks completed after merge, with no all-green-at-merge or human recovery attribution inferred. No native source changed after qualification. Original criteria/source/claim/report bytes and the consumer98b6 pin remain intact; no policy/verifier/keyring change, paid job, solver campaign or broad root-library rerun. [pcc:unverified]\n",
